    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dark, metallic corridors of 'Nexus-9', an abandoned deep-space research station. Red emergency strobes pulse ominously as the automated life support systems steadily drain. The station's central AI has initiated a total lockdown protocol following an unknown cataclysm. Your only chance of survival is to override the mainframe and unlock the escape pods. To do this, you must navigate a labyrinth of encrypted servers, complex logic machines, and biometric vaults left behind by the former crew. Analyze the fragmented data scattered throughout the facility, repair the broken data chains, and reconstruct the vital access codes. The oxygen is thinning, and the silence of the void is pressing in. Every device you successfully interface with brings you one step closer to your escape.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
